    "id": "distribute-pilot4",
    "language": "[0]All right, so in this situation, I need to figure out who I've got to pass the ball to s-- in order for our team to score the goal. Right now, I have a defender right in front of me and I have the ball, but I'm not able to take it straight to the goal, so I need to pass it to, to someone else. So we consider either the left striker or the right striker preferentially, but right now there's no clear path to them that the defender can't intercept the ball, because right now if I pass it to either of them, the defender can intercept the ball. So that would not be good. So now I'm going to consider the left winger or the right winger. I'm going to choose the left winger because there is a clear path over there. So I'm going to pass the ball to the left winger, and after that I'm going to move over there as support for the left winger. [1][2](breathing)[3] All right, so now I've appropriately passed the ball to the left winger, and then we can re-strategize and see if the left winger wants to pass it to me or someone else, or wants to take the ball somewhere else.",
